WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.100
Open the Projects list

2
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:12.300
Touch and hold a project

3
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.800
Move to Trash keeps a project for 30 days

4
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.400
Archive Project… keeps it for good

5
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.000
Confirm — nothing is deleted

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.500
It left the list

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.100
Archived — everything is still here

8
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.600
Restore Project brings it back

9
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:43.100
Back in the list, as it was
